[h1]Secrets of Ambrosius[/h1]

A magic and item crafting mod for Crusader Kings III. Seek out the hidden arts, master seven schools of magic, and forge enchanted arms for your house.

Built for CK3 1.21. An A Game of Thrones version is available: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3446353510]AGOT - Secrets of the Higher Mysteries[/url].

[h2]Magic[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Seven schools of magic[/b]: Blood, Shadow, Dream, Alchemy, Fire, Air and Water magic, with more than 320 mysteries (spells) between them.
[*][b]Mysteries scale with the caster[/b]: every mystery grows stronger with the caster's skill in its school. Caster skills are uncapped, so great masters are far more powerful than apprentices.
[*][b]Miscasts[/b]: your overall skill in magic decides whether a mystery goes wrong and harms the caster.
[*][b]Spellbook[/b]: see every mystery a mage knows, sorted by school, and search them by keyword.
[*][b]Use your realm's mages[/b]: choose which mage of your court and realm enacts mysteries on your behalf, or appoint a Court Mage.
[*][b]Mystery Casting map mode[/b]: click a province on the map to cast a mystery on it.
[*][b]Soothsaying[/b]: Dream magic visions can foretell births, reveal plots, and turn aside death from old age, assassins and battle.
[*][b]Magical assassination[/b]: drown, burn or haunt your enemies from afar. The victim can fight the working off, or find a healer who knows the old arts.
[*][b]Lasting workings[/b]: some mysteries keep working for years, such as the Breaking of the Dams, Stormcaller and Wildfire.
[*][b]Faiths of magic[/b]: eleven new tenets, from Blood Rites and Sacred Flame to Sorcery Anathema. Their teachings are found through rare discoveries.
[*][b]Seek out magic[/b]: search for magical knowledge, research new mysteries, study through the Further Magical Education scheme, and take on magical study contracts.
[*][b]Scrolls[/b]: scribe and learn mysteries from scrolls, which have their own inventory slot.
[*][b]Prophecy[/b]: dream magic brings visions and prophecies that can come to pass.
[*][b]Blood sacrifice[/b]: a dedicated activity for those who walk the darkest path.
[*][b]Drops of Power[/b]: a realm-wide view of the magical power at your disposal.
[*][b]Take a New Face[/b]: steal another's face through the darkest of arts.
[/list]

[h2]Item Crafting and Potions[/h2]
[list]
[*]Craft many types of items and enchant them with bonuses and modifiers.
[*]Craft a Mage's Grimoire, a book of enchantments.
[*]Brew ten potions, from the Elixir of Longevity to the Draught of Warding, and give them to others with the Administer Potion interaction.
[*]Bonuses scale with the crafter's skill in magic.
[*]Gift crafted artifacts to other characters.
[/list]

[h2]Characters[/h2]
[list]
[*]The house of Ambrosius, with its own phoenix coat of arms.
[*]Merlinus, a travelling merchant-mage.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
This mod edits the UI, so load it [b]low[/b] in your mod list.

It replaces the following base game files, so it is incompatible with other mods that edit them:
[list]
[*]common/character_interactions/00_grant_titles_interaction.txt
[*]common/character_interactions/00_heir.txt
[*]common/character_interactions/00_prison_interactions.txt
[*]common/combat_phase_events/00_commander_phase_events.txt
[*]common/combat_phase_events/00_knight_phase_events.txt
[*]common/on_action/death.txt
[*]common/scripted_rules/00_rules.txt
[*]common/scripted_triggers/20_health_triggers.txt
[*]common/succession_appointment/admin_governor.txt
[*]events/birth_events.txt
[*]events/health_events.txt
[*]events/single_combat_events.txt
[*]events/war_events/combat_events.txt
[*]gui/hud.gui
[*]gui/hud_outliner.gui
[*]gui/interaction_menu_window.gui
[*]gui/map_icon_layer_templates.gui
[*]gui/shared/cooltip.gui
[*]gui/shared/mapmodes.gui
[*]gui/shared/portraits.gui
[*]gui/window_army.gui
[*]gui/window_character.gui
[*]gui/window_combat.gui
[*]gui/window_inventory.gui
[*]gui/window_ledger.gui
[*]gui/window_my_realm.gui
[/list]

